data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md\", \"content\": \"# Dispatch d002: greet, tested\\n\\n## What was implemented\\n\\n1. `src/greet.py` — `greet(name)` returns `f\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\"`.\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` — unittest `TestCase` with two tests:\\n   - `test_normal_name`: `greet(\\\"Ada\\\") == \\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`\\n   - `test_empty_string`: `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`\\n\\n## Test run\\n\\nCommand: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`\\n\\n```\\n..\\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\\nRan 2 tests in 0.000s\\n\\nOK\\n```\\n\\nExit code: 0\\n\\n## Commit\\n\\n- Branch: `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>`\\n- Commit: `1236384ccd89500b50296b06ea57a85240f2907d`\\n- Message: \\\"Add greet function with unit tests\\\"\\n- Files changed: `src/greet.py`, `tests/test_greet.py` (2 files, 21 insertions)\\n\\nNo scope beyond what was requested.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

